content.text:
Build Planning/plan.md in its step order: for each step, first write the test the plan names, run it and show it failing, then stop; after you commit the failing test (Test first: <step>), write the code until it passes, then stop again so you commit it (Step <n>: <step>);
every test uses mock responses saved under tests/mock_responses/, and no test calls the real model or reads API_KEY;
the expected values in each test are the expected facts of the test plan, not values copied from a run;
after each step, run the whole test suite and stop if anything fails.
